    "detailed_description": "&quot;Spiral of War&quot; is a thrilling bullet-hell shooter game infused with modern warfare aesthetics. This innovative title seamlessly merges the mystery of vampires, survival tactics of &quot;Battle Royale&quot;, and the strategic combat of &quot;League of Legends&quot;, crafting a brand-new combat experience. The end of each battle isn't just a conclusion; players' equipment, skills, and progression are synchronized online, leaving a unique imprint of every skirmish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn every round of &quot;Spiral of War&quot;, players are not just entering a simple duel. They will face adversaries from various backgrounds and styles, each possessing distinct combat strategies and techniques. Players must utilize wit and skill, engaging in intense, heart-pounding brawls with these foes. This is not just a game; it's a comprehensive test of courage, strategy, and combat prowess.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt launch, four factions will make their debut:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMercenaries<br />\r\nChina<br />\r\nUSA<br />\r\nRussia",
